h1. Stories/Creative Writing

Decided to try my hand at making some stories! Currently, it's just some small faux-exerpts to practice, currently, but I hope to make something much larger in the future!

h2. Exerpts

- "First Steps":first_steps.html ["Plaintext":first_steps.txt] := A little warm up to see how horrendous I was when writing something without dialogue. Apparently not.
- "Sycamore Gap":sycamore_gap.html ["Plaintext":sycamore_gap.txt] := A man wakes up in the middle of the night to make a resolution about his life. More a short story.
- "Connection":connection.html ["Plaintext":connection.txt] := A depressed food service worker from the late 2040s finds something worth caring about.

I also have smaller "scraps":$, mostly from a creative writing course.

h2. Poetry

I write poetry for fun; not really because I'm a tortured thespian looking for reprive, it's just a nice little creative hobby that I feel like I'm good at.

- "I Am a Changeling":i-am-a-changeling.html ["Plaintext":i-am-a-changeling.txt] := A slapdash vent poem I made to air out some feelings. I don't know how good it is.
- "Forest Fire":forestfire.html ["Plaintext":forestfire.txt] := I have no idea what I really wrote, I just had some poetry strike me, and I wrote it down.
